_Created_ is the date the repository appeared on GitHub; _tracked since_ is the
first day covered by its repo-vitals archive. The two differ — a repo can be
years older than its analytics record, and everything below the 30-day columns
is only measured from the tracking start date. Repositories are flagged when
their data is older than {{ stale_after_days }} days.

