<sub>[repo-vitals](https://github.com/biterik/repo-vitals) by Erik Bitzek —
turns any GitHub repo into a permanent analytics archive; this hub
aggregates a whole fleet into one dashboard and one grant-ready report.
Data is read from each repository's public `vitals` branch; this hub has no
write access to anything.</sub>
